1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
She came for water.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,800
She left without her jar.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,220
Why?

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:07,080
About noon, a Samaritan woman comes to a well.

5
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,020
Jesus, a Jew, sits there, tired.

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,900
Give me to drink.

7
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:18,300
How is it that thou, being a Jew, askest drink

8
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:18,800
of me?

9
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,680
Jews and Samaritans kept apart.

10
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,600
He asks anyway.

11
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,040
Whosoever drinketh of this water shall thirst

12
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:26,560
again.

13
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:29,140
Then he offers her a different water, a gift

14
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:29,760
from God.

15
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:32,640
Drink it and you shall never thirst.

16
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:36,680
Life from God inside you, a spring that never

17
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,340
runs dry.

18
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,280
Then he tells her the truth about her life.

19
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:42,960
Five husbands and the man she has now is not

20
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,500
her husband.

21
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,600
He knew it all and stayed.

22
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:49,960
She says the Christ, the one God promised will

23
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:50,360
come.

24
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:53,880
I that speak unto thee am he.

25
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,040
He is the Christ.

26
00:00:56,990 --> 00:00:59,460
She leaves her jar and goes back to town.

27
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:04,920
Come, see a man, which told me all things that

28
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:08,460
ever I did is not this, the Christ.

29
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:12,180
Many come, hear him, and call him the savior

30
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,040
of the world.

31
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,020
The jar stayed.

32
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:18,160
She came for water and found the one who gives

33
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:22,240
better water, Jesus, who knew her whole story

34
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,860
and offered her life.

35
00:01:23,860 --> 00:01:26,920
To give that life, he died for our sins and

36
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,020
rose the third day.
